Subject: Add opt-in cold handle stage and fresh-process controls
Why: AC-T7.4.1/HEX-RT-17: the borrowed contract's Windows cold handle delta (96 to 107) is unattributed. With HEX_BORROWED_STAGE_HANDLES=1 the first round reports its handle count at 19 fixed boundaries after the cold cut, and two ignored ROOT-only fresh-process controls isolate AF_UNIX bind/drop and thread start/join. A cold delta stays reported as uncertain; no allowance. Test-only; ported from cp/t7-borrowed-cold-handles 80c40809.

